### Lesson 2 — test every endpoint.
### Works in Visual Studio 2022 (click "Send request") and in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. All car models
GET {{host}}/api/cars/models

### 2. One model
GET {{host}}/api/cars/models/Volt-X

### 3. Available new cars under $45,000 (your Lesson 1 homework, as an API)
GET {{host}}/api/cars/inventory?condition=New&maxPrice=45000

### 4. Family cars: 7+ seats
GET {{host}}/api/cars/inventory?minSeats=7

### 5. A sold car should return 404 (privacy!)
GET {{host}}/api/cars/inventory/1LKSMT26A00000006

### 6. Financing offers for the Volt-X (homework #2)
GET {{host}}/api/financing?modelName=Volt-X

### 7. Monthly payment: Ocean Blue Breeze, 60-month offer, minimum down
GET {{host}}/api/financing/estimate?vin=1LKBRZ26A00000002&offerId=2

### 8. Down payment too small -> 400 with a helpful message
GET {{host}}/api/financing/estimate?vin=1LKBRZ26A00000002&offerId=2&downPayment=500

### 9. Brake pads for the Summit (out of stock)
GET {{host}}/api/parts?search=brake&modelName=Summit

### 10. Policy topics, then one policy
GET {{host}}/api/policies

###
GET {{host}}/api/policies/insurance

### 11. Private data WITHOUT verifying -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/customers/me/vehicles

### 12. Wrong VIN digits -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/customers/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "616-555-0101", "vinLast4": "9999" }

### 13. Correct details -> token
# @name verify
POST {{host}}/api/customers/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "(616) 555-0101", "vinLast4": "0006" }

### 14. Anita's own car, using the token from request 13
GET {{host}}/api/customers/me/vehicles
X-Customer-Token: {{verify.response.body.$.token}}
